{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT : 250ms2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average human reaction time is about 250ms. Do you have faster-than-average reflexes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bd\u00a0</strong>Control your character with the arrow keys or WASD. When enemies briefly turn green, click quickly to defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/250ms2_screenshot (6)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>\u25bd\u00a0</strong>Explore four themed stages, encounter various types of monsters, and clear all enemies to advance to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/250ms2_screenshot (7)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>\u25bd\u00a0</strong>Use the gold earned from defeating monsters to upgrade your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/250ms2_screenshot (8)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>\u25bd\u00a0</strong>Face off against powerful bosses at the end of each theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/250ms2_screenshot (5)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong>Clear all stages to reach the ending.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950170?t=1757410928","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950170?t=1757410928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950170/d4e19a4e01c80817dd81ba66f064103adfa05105/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757410928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950170/d4e19a4e01c80817dd81ba66f064103adfa05105/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757410928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Family Sharin